      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Ovarian remnant syndrome is an unfortunate complication after bilateral oophorectomy. A case of an ovarian remnant involving the hypogastric vasculature is presented. Successful surgical management required resection of the involved hypogastric artery."},
